;;; `open` written as a top-level fact's relation loads, as a relation —
;;; **W70**, regression `fact-head`.
;;;
;;; ── What this program is ───────────────────────────────────────────────
;;;
;;; `(open x)` is a fact, so `open` stands as the relation it is a fact of.
;;;
